== Description ==

'''Yellow Wax Stone''' is a mineable rock in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Cutting Workbench]]. It appears as an ingredient in 36 downstream recipes at the [[Cutting Workbench]], including [[Lapis Lazuli]], [[Yellow Wax Stone]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

